#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Mine slabs of splendid dense iron ore in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the slabs of splendid dense iron ore to Qhoterl Pasol</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n4 == 17)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Gather bunches of splendid roots in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the bunches of splendid roots to Qhoterl Pasol</… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 4 == 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Gather bunches of splendid roots in the depths of Lake Tusi Mek'ta<else>Deliver the bunches of splendid roots to Qhoterl Pasol</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
